---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Stack frame vs heap escape decision matching bce_clean.go:
// Left: sumDown(&a, &b) borrows pointers downward, so a and b stay on caller's stack.
// Right: sumUp(a, b) returns &z upward, forcing z to escape to the shared heap.
const W = 900;
const H = 315;
---
<figure class="gp16e">
  <div class="gp16e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: sumDown borrows pointers from the caller stack frame so everything stays on the stack and pops on return. Right: sumUp returns &z past its popped stack frame, forcing z onto the shared heap.">
    {/* Left panel: Stack only (sharing down) */}
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Sharing down: sumDown(&amp;a, &amp;b)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Truyền xuống: sumDown(&amp;a, &amp;b)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="44" width="390" height="200" rx="8" class="frame" />
    <DiagramIcon name="stack" x={50} y={63} size={26} />
    <text x="72" y="68" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Goroutine stack (private, LIFO)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Stack của goroutine (riêng, LIFO)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Caller frame */}
    <rect x="36" y="82" width="358" height="62" rx="6" class="good" />
    <text x="50" y="104" class="b">caller frame</text>
    <text x="50" y="126" class="m num">a = 3 · b = 2</text>
    <text x="380" y="118" text-anchor="end" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stays valid</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>còn hiệu lực</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Callee frame */}
    <rect x="36" y="158" width="358" height="68" rx="6" class="dash" />
    <text x="50" y="180" class="b">sumDown frame</text>
    <text x="50" y="202" class="m">x = &amp;a · y = &amp;b</text>
    <text x="380" y="196" text-anchor="end" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>pops on return</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>tự dọn khi return</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Arrow from x/y up to caller frame */}
    <path d="M 190 158 L 190 150" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="190,144 185,152 195,152" class="hd" />

    <text x="20" y="272" class="b num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Heap cost: 0 B/op, 0 allocs/op</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chi phí heap: 0 B/op, 0 allocs/op</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="294" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>SP bumps back on return; zero GC work</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thanh ghi SP lùi lại khi thoát hàm; GC không cần quét</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="440" x2="440" y1="20" y2="298" class="rule" />

    {/* Right panel: Escapes to heap (sharing up) */}
    <text x="468" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Sharing up: return &amp;z</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Trả lên trên: return &amp;z</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="468" y="44" width="215" height="200" rx="8" class="frame" />
    <DiagramIcon name="stack" x={496} y={63} size={26} />
    <text x="518" y="68" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Goroutine stack</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Stack goroutine</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="482" y="82" width="187" height="62" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="494" y="104" class="b">caller frame</text>
    <text x="494" y="126" class="r">ptr := sumUp(3, 2)</text>

    <rect x="482" y="158" width="187" height="68" rx="6" class="dash" />
    <text x="494" y="180" class="m">sumUp frame</text>
    <text x="494" y="202" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>popped on return</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đã thu hồi</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Shared Heap box */}
    <rect x="712" y="44" width="168" height="200" rx="8" class="bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="heap" x={740} y={63} size={26} />
    <text x="762" y="68" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shared heap</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Heap dùng chung</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="726" y="88" width="140" height="54" rx="6" class="cell" />
    <text x="796" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="b">z = 5</text>
    <text x="796" y="131" text-anchor="middle" class="r">moved to heap</text>

    <text x="726" y="176" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Outlives sumUp,</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Sống qua sumUp,</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="726" y="196" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>tracked by GC</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>GC phải theo dõi</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Arrow from caller ptr to heap z */}
    <path d="M 670 115 L 718 115" class="lnr" />
    <polygon points="725,115 716,110 716,120" class="hdr" />
    <circle class="dot fm-dot" r="4"><animateMotion dur="1.8s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M 676 115 L 716 115" /></circle>

    <text x="468" y="272" class="r num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Heap cost: 8 B/op, 1 alloc/op (~3x slower)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Chi phí heap: 8 B/op, 1 alloc/op (chậm hơn ~3 lần)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="468" y="294" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Compiler emits: moved to heap: z</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Compiler báo: moved to heap: z</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The Go compiler obeys two escape invariants: a stack pointer may never enter the heap, and may never outlive its declaring frame. Borrowing pointers downward keeps values on the self-cleaning stack; returning an address upward forces heap allocation.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trình biên dịch Go giữ hai bất biến: con trỏ tới biến stack không được lưu trên heap, và không được sống lâu hơn stack frame khai báo nó. Truyền con trỏ xuống giữ biến ở stack tự dọn; trả địa chỉ lên trên ép cấp phát trên heap.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp16e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp16e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp16e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp16e text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp16e .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp16e .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp16e .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp16e .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp16e .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp16e .frame { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16e .box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16e .cell { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16e .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16e .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16e .dash { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp16e .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp16e .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp16e .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp16e .lnr { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gp16e .hdr { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp16e .dot { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp16e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
